Description: Fix musl portability of OSU benchmarks
 .
 - osu_util_validation.c: __intNN_t leak from glibc headers -> stdint.h types
 - osu_util.c: strsep() on a string literal (crashes on musl) -> strdup first
 - osu_util_mpi.c: off-by-2 heap overflow in --help path (malloc(strlen+3))
   which corrupts the heap and aborts in free() with musl mallocng
Origin: vendor, Jean Iaquinta <jeani@uio.no>
Upstream-status: pending
